# The Battle Tree: the great tree at the head of Poni Gauntlet, a hall where trainers stake a streak. Proud brass in A minor
# over a string pad, timpani and a driving bass, a steel drum turning the chords and a hard kit with a fill every fourth
# bar. One arrangement for day and night, as the hall has no sky of its own.
# Original composition for this game, in the modern sound.
